WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
S binds reversibly at the enzyme’s active site.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Together they form the enzyme–substrate complex, ES.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Catalysis lowers the activation barrier as S becomes P.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Product leaves. The enzyme remains available for another cycle.
